  "summary": "Compact-pattern pod carrier. Fast for seventy-five tonnes, and armoured like it is not.",
  "lore": "The HLB hulls are the only Compact design Sarn admits it cannot build, only maintain: a forward-slung spine on reversed legs, with the entire payload in two shoulder pods that come off with eight bolts and a crane. The foundry has learned to swap a pod in an afternoon, which is why a Halberd is whatever its last quartermaster decided it was. It walks at the speed of a medium, stands up to fire that folds a Bulwark, and every company that owns one has a story about what it cost them.",
